<title>Mexico's cartel violence: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/mexico/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-mexico-2026-10-25T06:31:57.762Z</guid>
<pubDate>Sun, 25 Oct 2026 06:31:57 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Cartel gunmen opened fire on a bus of students in Mexico, killing multiple passengers, while a separate school bus shooting in Sinaloa injured the driver. Federal authorities arrested an alleged cartel leader linked to a deadly car bombing and detained four Pacific cartel members in Chiapas with weapons and a stolen truck. A former state attorney general was charged with treason over alleged U.S. involvement in a drug raid, and a Texas man was indicted for buying firearms to supply the Sinaloa Cartel. Kidnap survivors described brutal conditions in a cartel prison camp, and a Hells Angels boss was arrested in Cancún, marking a second biker bust in 2026. The conflict’s historical toll includes 37 battle-related deaths in 1996, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiiAFBVV95cUxNVEVFQmJseGNjZnVKUGtmRzlmdGRqdHA1Z1Bab1lyVzhEMF94WjN3dzgwR09TSUZ2SENNcmpDVlUyX3FPUkZCM0x2dlI5Q29oQnA5Y3RjU0R6ZHdkYVF1MmxHN01CWklzRHFFS2xqaVZNcEtHN25wRnR2UU5vb2h0cVdZdUNqSVVL?oc=5&quot;&gt;The New York Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMijgFBVV95cUxOeEhsSmxXM2NyN3pZOUlXRWVOVEh2SFJlQzI2SlNnRHlzREY0cEhNWEZma01VNXI4QUt3UktlX2xtRTVPY21ra21jWlZzNTRxOENZTEVxN3hscldOSW5Gd0VuYzVFanVRQ0FTUFItSHM0TE9WMEs3UnNBZW5GeFBROVlxREV1M0NFM1gzSkpn?oc=5&quot;&gt;Parriva&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiywFBVV95cUxQZ0cyeTJVckZOQktTM0NsOURtXzE5cXBwZlpiTndHd0g5cHZuV2JnVDZJNllCWGIwcUtJYlo1MC1EMmJDMzNtbUNDNzR2UUptMjRCU3kydlcwMFg4X1FwbTVsYmlsaVQ5M0dkUFRoM1duTTZBYnluTmg0aUlSYk5OUlNGNjlRNEE0SGYtRnV6Q0NieDNNXzRYbEVENFU5VERfTXM4Y2dzVUJtLUJmZmg0NUdRd3JnWVlnd0JpbUZBWXE3Y1JtaHM2eGRkRQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;SonoraPresente&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMinwFBVV95cUxNS184aGRfRUFFT0RxSzZLUHEzX2hsbnBKV3hmbEZvY1RvTjZqSkJRd3J0bWJmeVVUVmNW